    "alert_id": "ALERT_003",
    "title": "No clinician assessment or plan documented",
    "message": "Guidelines emphasise integrated screening for HIV and NCD comorbidities at each clinic visit. This patient presents with significant metabolic abnormalities (pre-diabetes, dyslipidaemia, obesity, elevated BP) yet no assessment or plan was documented. Guidelines specify treatment goals of BP <140/90, FBG <7 mmol/L, and viral load suppression. Without a documented plan, there is risk of missed intervention for progressive metabolic syndrome and cardiovascular risk.",
    "issue_type": "plan_review",
